</span></span></td>
<td id="S5.T1.3.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding:0.5pt 5.0pt;" rowspan="2"><span id="S5.T1.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_text">
<span id="S5.T1.3.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block">
